<section id="about" class="about-content">
  <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          I am a game developer building <strong>Valet Overdrive</strong> &mdash; a turn-based,
          2D tile-based valet parking puzzle game where "Into the Breach meets Balatro."
          Players manage a dynamic parking lot, park cars, navigate hazards, and race against
          the clock in 10-turn shifts.
        </p>
        <p>
          The game is built entirely in <strong>Godot 4.7.2</strong> using GDScript, featuring
          procedural texturing via TileMap2D autotiling, A* pathfinding with dynamic grid
          expansion, a signal-bus architecture, and a turn-based energy economy.
        </p>
        <div class="tech-stack">
          <h3>Tech Stack</h3>
          <div class="tech-items">
            <span class="tech-item">Godot 4.7.2</span>
            <span class="tech-item">GDScript</span>
            <span class="tech-item">TileMap2D Autotiling</span>
            <span class="tech-item">A* Pathfinding</span>
            <span class="tech-item">Signal Bus Pattern</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
